{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00726","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享隐太子庙乐章 诚和 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 享隐太子庙乐章 诚和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"道閟鹤关，运缠鸠里。\n门集大命，俾歆嘉祀。\n礼亚六瑚，诚殚二簋。\n有诚顒若，神斯戾止。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00726.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00726","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}